# A scripted ride for the goldens: walk up to the bike and get on (as
# mount.script), wait on the pad, then full throttle north up the lane. The
# chase camera climbs toward the crest near frame 692; the rider camera then
# sees the block ahead. The throttle opens at 282, once getting on's fade
# (black while the bike rises) has cleared, on the gauge's 6-step refresh.
#   functor -d examples/hoverbike run native -- --input-script ride.script \
#     --capture-frame /tmp/f.png --capture-at-frame 692 --capture-size 1600x1200
10 W down
100 W up
120 E down
121 E up
282 W down
922 C down
923 C up
